data: {"answer": "這裡是宴會廳門口，系統顯示登入失敗並被記錄。連續輸入錯誤密碼會導致帳號鎖定並通知資安監控中心。請檢查走廊的資安政策公告欄，確認密碼長度與螢幕鎖定時間後再試一次。此處主要展示活動報名報到系統，並提醒注意多因素驗證疲勞攻擊等威脅。", "go": [], "followups": [{"text": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？", "en": "What does the Event Registration & Check-in do?", "zh": "活動報名報到系統是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊要怎麼防？", "en": "How do we prevent MFA fatigue (push bombing)?", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "接下來要去哪？", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "zh", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.1, "total_s": 8.11}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "door_8062", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "door_8062"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 5.5}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "door_8062", "label": "Room", "en": "Banquet Hall Door (wrong code)", "zh": "宴會廳門口（密碼錯誤）"}, {"key": "event_system", "label": "System", "en": "Event Registration & Check-in", "zh": "活動報名報到系統"}, {"key": "mfa_fatigue", "label": "Threat", "en": "MFA Fatigue (Push Bombing)", "zh": "多因素驗證疲勞攻擊"}, {"key": "credential_stuffing", "label": "Threat", "en": "Password Guessing & Credential Stuffing", "zh": "密碼猜測與撞庫"}, {"key": "mfa", "label": "Control", "en": "Multi-Factor Authentication", "zh": "多因素驗證"}, {"key": "c_authentication", "label": "Concept", "en": "Authentication Factors", "zh": "驗證因素"}], "edges": [{"a": "event_system", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "credential_stuffing", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "mfa_fatigue", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "c_authentication", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "mfa"}, {"a": "mfa", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "door_8062"}, {"a": "mfa", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "credential_stuffing"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "房間：宴會廳門口・驗證失敗（導覽裡的名稱：宴會廳門口（密碼錯誤））\n這裡講的是：輸錯被拒絕，也被記錄；連續失敗會鎖帳號並通知資安監控中心。\n重點：登入失敗是要注意的警訊。\n要繼續往前走：密碼錯了。就在這裡再輸入一次：先打密碼至少要幾個字元，再打螢幕幾分鐘鎖定，兩個數字都在走廊的資安政策公告欄上。\n這裡的系統：活動報名報到系統\n這裡要注意的威脅：多因素驗證疲勞攻擊、密碼猜測與撞庫\n看得到的防護措施：多因素驗證\n課程概念：驗證因素\n相關的處理流程：收到不是自己發起的多因素驗證通知\n可以走到：資安訓練室", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.1, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 694, "prompt_s": 2.33, "gen_tokens": 75, "gen_s": 5.74, "tok_per_s": 13.1, "first_token_s": 2.35}}, "state": {}}

